WEBVTT

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.540
My right hand holds a bowl of gold,

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:20.350
And my left holds one of silver.

00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:24.480
Never one without the other,

00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:37.630
Two unseen bowls for each of us.

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:46.040
The golden one is filled with joy,

00:00:46.110 --> 00:00:53.450
shining warmly.

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:58.190
Since we met, my golden bowl

00:00:58.250 --> 00:01:05.130
cannot hold all my happiness and love.

00:01:06.930 --> 00:01:15.340
Golden joy, silver sadness,

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:22.610
I would leave my past behind...

00:01:22.610 --> 00:01:27.420
For you, for the sake of love,

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:34.360
I would empty the bowls of my past.

00:02:01.780 --> 00:02:04.850
Tomoko, it's Nanako on the phone...

00:02:06.050 --> 00:02:07.390
Tomoko!

00:02:07.990 --> 00:02:09.590
Tell her I'm sleeping.

00:02:09.590 --> 00:02:10.990
Oh come on!

00:02:10.990 --> 00:02:12.930
It's only eight-thirty!

00:02:12.930 --> 00:02:14.660
Then tell her I'm not back home yet.

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:18.070
What's happened with you two? A quarrel?

00:02:18.330 --> 00:02:19.930
I just can't talk to her now!

00:02:28.740 --> 00:02:31.280
You shouldn't bother waiting for Nanako-san.

00:02:31.810 --> 00:02:32.550
What?

00:02:33.610 --> 00:02:36.950
She won't be able to go home with you.

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:40.760
As a member of the Sorority, she has a lot of socializing to do.

00:02:42.690 --> 00:02:45.760
Keep in mind that she is no longer an ordinary student.

00:02:56.100 --> 00:02:56.900
Tough!

00:03:01.310 --> 00:03:03.180
So how is Tomoko?

00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:05.650
She's not back yet...

00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:06.710
Oh?

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:13.050
...but that can't be...

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:16.660
Good night!

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:19.190
Umm... Nanako?

00:03:19.190 --> 00:03:20.060
Yes?

00:03:20.060 --> 00:03:22.200
With regard to...

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:22.930
Yes?

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:27.340
...Henmi-san, the one who sent you the package...

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:30.810
What is your relationship with him?

00:03:31.340 --> 00:03:34.210
Don't worry! There's nothing to worry about!

00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:37.080
It's nothing at all.

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:40.820
He was just a teacher at our cram school.

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:42.750
That was just a present he sent me for passing my entrance exams.

00:03:43.020 --> 00:03:47.760
Oh? That's nice. Did you thank him?

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:51.690
Yes... but I wouldn't tell Dad about it...

00:03:52.890 --> 00:03:55.900
I wouldn't want him worrying...

00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:58.630
Yes, that's best...

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:07.640
Of course Misonoo-san's womanhood...

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:13.180
...should be especially good as far as cooking and selling is concerned!

00:04:13.450 --> 00:04:14.720
What! Why?

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:16.390
Her womanhood...?

00:04:16.390 --> 00:04:18.520
You didn't know?

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:22.260
Her mother used to work at an establishment near Jyoto University... as a Cocktail Waitress!

00:04:22.260 --> 00:04:23.860
Cocktail waitress?!

00:04:28.730 --> 00:04:30.070
Why are you looking at me that way?

00:04:30.070 --> 00:04:32.070
Nothing, never mind...

00:04:37.410 --> 00:04:39.410
Brother, dear brother...

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:44.810
The more I try to believe Mom and Dad, the more doubts I seem to have...

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:50.090
and I'm not brave enough to ask them.

00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:52.420
Did he really have another child?

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:55.760
And another wife, the child's mother?

00:04:55.960 --> 00:05:01.760
5. Thorns of Doubt and Suspicion

00:05:06.900 --> 00:05:09.710
Oh no! I've got to get on the train, or I'm gonna be late!

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:18.180
What! It left half an hour earlier than usual?!

00:05:24.650 --> 00:05:26.790
Tomoko is avoiding me.

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:30.330
Perhaps because I was chosen as a Sorority member?

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:36.470
["He was still silent, and seemed to be lost in thought."]

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:40.540
["When I rose to leave, he did not invite me to stay.."] <b> </b>

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:41.540
["When I rose to leave, he did not invite me to stay.."] But Tomoko will understand.

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:45.010
But Tomoko will understand.

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:47.940
We've been together since elementary school.

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:51.480
We've been friends a long time.

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:10.630
Tomoko!

00:06:11.100 --> 00:06:13.040
Is that for sure?

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:14.900
Yes! It's true!

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:16.510
You're kidding!

00:06:16.510 --> 00:06:17.510
Tomoko!

00:06:17.970 --> 00:06:20.310
So! What is your Cooking Club specialty?

00:06:20.310 --> 00:06:22.650
I picked cookies and baking!

00:06:22.650 --> 00:06:25.110
You know, I think I will too!

00:06:25.850 --> 00:06:31.450
So anyway! The story you just told me was... the funniest yet!

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:33.260
Tomoko!

00:06:37.390 --> 00:06:39.330
Tomoko, I need to talk to you!

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:42.470
Can't now. I have an appointment.

00:06:42.470 --> 00:06:44.930
But it won't take long!

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:48.610
Anyway, there's someone waiting who is more your type.

00:06:48.610 --> 00:06:49.740
What?

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:51.740
Nanako-san!

00:06:54.480 --> 00:06:55.280
Tomoko...!

00:06:55.880 --> 00:06:57.610
My goodness, Arikura-san!

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:01.690
Tomoko...

00:07:03.220 --> 00:07:04.820
Let's hurry!

00:07:05.560 --> 00:07:08.560
We have to prepare for the Sorority initiation!

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:11.090
We should be the first ones there.

00:07:11.090 --> 00:07:13.230
The Big Sisters frown on being late!

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:18.030
The Sorority is our highest priority!

00:07:18.030 --> 00:07:19.440
You know that!

00:07:27.510 --> 00:07:29.110
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:45.460
Rei!

00:07:47.460 --> 00:07:48.930
Rei!

00:07:59.810 --> 00:08:01.610
You make me so angry!

00:08:01.610 --> 00:08:03.150
You're STILL taking these!

00:08:03.150 --> 00:08:04.820
When will it sink in?!

00:08:12.020 --> 00:08:14.490
When indeed, "Doctor" Orihara...

00:08:15.030 --> 00:08:17.290
I still have one left, you know.

00:08:20.360 --> 00:08:21.500
You're looking great!

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:26.100
The light in your eyes makes me happy to be alive.

00:08:30.840 --> 00:08:32.440
Is something happening here?

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:42.920
We are going to the Sorority House, Misonoo-san, Shinobu-san...

00:09:02.010 --> 00:09:04.610
Won't you come with us?

00:09:05.010 --> 00:09:07.410
You could be very helpful to us if you came too.

00:09:29.230 --> 00:09:30.970
Saint-Juste-sama...

00:09:32.970 --> 00:09:37.910
...she acts like a docile sheep whenever Miya-sama is nearby...

00:09:42.850 --> 00:09:43.920
Rei!

00:09:44.380 --> 00:09:46.450
Are you going to wear that bracelet FOREVER?

00:10:00.130 --> 00:10:05.270
Those flowers go there... and that table goes at the corner...

00:10:05.470 --> 00:10:07.870
And this white vase... to show off the flowers!

00:10:10.610 --> 00:10:13.210
Yes, like that, close to the tapestry...

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:15.280
Asaka-san... over here, please.

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:18.620
Over here...

00:10:24.020 --> 00:10:26.630
Could you hold that corner?

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:30.100
What on earth is going on?

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:35.630
Shinobu-san... that should go on the table, on the right.

00:11:12.810 --> 00:11:14.810
Blood! Bloodstains!

00:11:41.830 --> 00:11:43.300
Please bandage me.

00:11:43.640 --> 00:11:44.900
Use THIS.

00:11:45.910 --> 00:11:47.040
You do it!

00:11:47.440 --> 00:11:48.310
You!

00:11:52.040 --> 00:11:53.980
Komabayashi-san, take care of her.

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:55.250
Ok. <b> </b>

00:11:55.250 --> 00:11:56.720
Ok. You!

00:11:58.450 --> 00:11:59.990
You!

00:12:00.520 --> 00:12:01.590
Let go!

00:12:02.260 --> 00:12:04.060
Please let go of that!

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:16.200
Nanako, oh my!

00:12:19.940 --> 00:12:22.010
I certainly didn't imagine THAT!

00:12:22.280 --> 00:12:27.080
I'm certain that Miya-sama did that deliberately.

00:12:28.750 --> 00:12:30.280
Why would she do that?!

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:55.710
Once again...

00:12:57.510 --> 00:12:59.650
she acts just like a man would

00:13:14.260 --> 00:13:15.530
Miya-sama, right?

00:13:17.460 --> 00:13:18.670
Why is it?

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:22.070
Why do you insist on torturing yourself?

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:25.140
Enough is enough!

00:13:26.070 --> 00:13:27.610
Rei...!

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:44.360
So now, the new members will sign in...

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:48.230
and will receive some flowers and a greeting from Fukiko-sama.

00:13:49.030 --> 00:13:50.760
Shinobu Mariko...

00:13:55.500 --> 00:14:02.710
As an honorable sorority member will you obey the rules of the sorority...

00:14:02.710 --> 00:14:07.710
and dedicate yourself to develop the spirit of the sorority with love and pride?

00:14:07.710 --> 00:14:08.920
I will!

00:14:10.180 --> 00:14:12.250
Congratulations, Mariko-san.

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:16.790
Your smile is as refreshing as an azalea!

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:19.790
Please, never lose that lovely smile!

00:14:24.670 --> 00:14:26.400
Thank you so very much!

00:14:29.270 --> 00:14:31.070
Misonoo Nanako-san...

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:40.150
As an honorable sorority member will you obey the rules...

00:14:43.080 --> 00:14:49.020
The love that you receive comes from the love you create within the kindness of your own heart.

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:08.510
Coming!

00:15:11.780 --> 00:15:13.250
Who is it?

00:15:13.710 --> 00:15:16.050
I'm sorry, I didn't call first...

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:17.520
Huh?

00:15:27.730 --> 00:15:29.060
It's you...!

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:33.800
Come on, geez, what's with you!!

00:15:33.800 --> 00:15:36.740
Nanako, you've been in such a weird mood all day!

00:15:36.940 --> 00:15:41.810
When you bandaged Sainte-Juste, all by yourself...?

00:15:41.810 --> 00:15:42.680
Uh-huh...

00:15:42.680 --> 00:15:47.150
Didn't you realize that Miya-sama was glaring at you?

00:15:47.150 --> 00:15:49.820
It gave me a cold sweat!

00:15:51.420 --> 00:15:56.760
You fool! Don't defy Miya-sama! You can't go against her will!

00:15:56.760 --> 00:16:00.830
You can be voted out of the Sorority at any time!

00:16:00.830 --> 00:16:04.700
Furthermore, her father is on the Board of Directors at our school!

00:16:05.500 --> 00:16:07.170
Are you even listening to me?

00:16:07.570 --> 00:16:09.240
Hey, Nanako-san!!

00:16:13.040 --> 00:16:14.310
My dear Brother...

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:19.250
I dare not tell anyone what Miya-sama did...

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:21.720
Nor about Saint-Juste's attitude toward Miya-sama...

00:16:22.850 --> 00:16:25.050
...these glimpses of their true feelings...

00:16:26.320 --> 00:16:29.930
This is all beyond my understanding.

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:32.530
And it frightens me.

00:16:41.540 --> 00:16:45.610
You've never been able to forgive us..

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:51.750
At first, I blamed you for taking my father away from us,

00:16:52.680 --> 00:16:56.750
And I resented my father for loving you more than my mother and me.

00:17:01.090 --> 00:17:02.020
But then...

00:17:04.560 --> 00:17:11.830
You kept sending money until I was an adult... even after Mother died.

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:22.310
Somehow, every month - you couldn't have done it on a professor's salary alone..

00:17:23.780 --> 00:17:25.310
As I grew older...

00:17:25.710 --> 00:17:29.250
...I began to understand.

00:17:32.990 --> 00:17:37.730
To forgive or not to forgive... to blame or not to blame...

00:17:39.330 --> 00:17:44.200
Finally the issue somehow didn't seem important anymore.

00:17:45.600 --> 00:17:47.140
Takehiko-san!

00:17:56.080 --> 00:17:57.950
Nanako is charming!

00:18:00.220 --> 00:18:04.620
I've come to feel... like she really is my sister.

00:18:05.820 --> 00:18:09.890
But when I first found out, I was shocked!

00:18:15.430 --> 00:18:18.500
Please! Be my brother!

00:18:18.500 --> 00:18:20.300
your name is...?

00:18:20.300 --> 00:18:22.170
Misonoo Nanako.

00:18:22.170 --> 00:18:26.710
Misonoo? Daughter of Professor Misonoo of Jyoto University?

00:18:31.510 --> 00:18:35.990
Accepting her request meant that eventually you would find out...

00:18:36.390 --> 00:18:37.920
That bothered me.

00:18:38.660 --> 00:18:39.990
On the other hand...

00:18:39.990 --> 00:18:43.590
...if I could do something for her as a brother,

00:18:43.590 --> 00:18:47.600
Then.. then that's what I wanted to do.

00:18:52.070 --> 00:18:56.410
I have one request... please...

00:18:56.870 --> 00:18:58.010
Ok.

00:18:58.010 --> 00:19:03.210
We haven't told Nanako that her father has another child.

00:19:04.810 --> 00:19:12.290
If we tell her, she'd be hurt unnecessarily, and blame us, so...

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:13.820
We won't have to tell her.

00:19:14.490 --> 00:19:20.100
I'll just be one among many.. a friend she confided in, during her adolescence.

00:19:21.500 --> 00:19:23.430
Thank you so much!

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:24.630
You're welcome.

00:19:57.600 --> 00:20:00.670
Nanako! You'll hurt yourself! Stop!

00:20:02.740 --> 00:20:07.680
...the hand which touched my hair, that often tossed the ball to me...

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:14.020
handing me "Tom Sawyer", cleaning out his pipe... only 6 months ago!

00:20:20.090 --> 00:20:25.160
Father... I've lost you!

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:28.370
I should never have come here.

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:30.170
Surely...

00:20:30.170 --> 00:20:32.700
Father... my father...

00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:45.920
Father...

00:21:48.450 --> 00:21:52.120
That was you on the phone just now, I know it.

00:21:52.520 --> 00:21:53.990
I won't answer.

00:21:53.990 --> 00:21:58.120
I'll get even for today, for hurting me so!

00:22:11.070 --> 00:22:17.410
The love that you receive comes from the love you create within the kindness of your own heart.

00:22:18.480 --> 00:22:20.410
Thank you very much.

00:22:22.280 --> 00:22:27.550
At the same time, love creates hate and doubt and anger.

00:22:28.350 --> 00:22:30.960
Don't be afraid of people hurting you.

00:22:32.090 --> 00:22:34.630
But if you do get hurt...

00:22:35.360 --> 00:22:38.230
...then hurt the person who hurt you.

00:23:05.860 --> 00:23:07.390
Nanako!

00:23:08.860 --> 00:23:11.600
Nanako... are you OK?

00:23:11.930 --> 00:23:13.200
Nanako!

00:23:13.470 --> 00:23:15.600
It's nothing... I'm ok!

00:23:15.600 --> 00:23:18.270
It was just a nightmare.

00:23:18.740 --> 00:23:20.470
Ok.

00:23:20.470 --> 00:23:23.810
If you can't go back to sleep, come to my study,

00:23:23.810 --> 00:23:25.880
I'll be up for awhile.

00:23:26.350 --> 00:23:28.410
Thank-you, Daddy...

00:23:35.090 --> 00:23:41.430
It rained until just before dawn...

00:24:10.190 --> 00:24:14.390
I dreamed I was chasing a rainbow...

00:24:14.390 --> 00:24:19.870
Then the rainbow I was chasing was you.

00:24:21.330 --> 00:24:25.470
Before, I had no strength, no will.

00:24:25.470 --> 00:24:30.940
But now because of you, I do.

00:24:31.680 --> 00:24:37.220
Feelings of love, like raindrops

00:24:37.220 --> 00:24:42.690
Come pouring from the sky.

00:24:42.690 --> 00:24:45.430
This is surely a game

00:24:45.430 --> 00:24:48.230
Of some mischievous fairy...

00:24:48.230 --> 00:24:50.630
Always dancing,

00:24:50.630 --> 00:24:55.900
Always capricious...

00:25:03.710 --> 00:25:10.780
Nanako's gym clothes, missing from her locker, are finally found. They are shredded.

00:25:11.120 --> 00:25:15.790
The petition to oust her from the sorority continues to circulate.

00:25:15.790 --> 00:25:18.790
Nanako finally decides to leave the sorority...

00:25:19.190 --> 00:25:20.060
Next episode: <b> </b>

00:25:20.060 --> 00:25:22.200
Next episode: Lost and Alone

00:25:22.460 --> 00:25:24.060
Brother, Dear Brother... <b> </b>

00:25:24.060 --> 00:25:28.070
Brother, Dear Brother... There is no end to my tears...
